CORE
main.c

^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .*: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* end of other is reachable: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
pointer handling for concurrency is unsound
--
A shared pointer that another thread sets to an offset into a different array:
the dereference must consider that object and offset.
